'''Junior God Suruzu''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 234
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Junior God Suruzu
|name2 = Junior God Suruzu CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Junior God Suruzu CC''' at level 10

==Strategy/Usage==
Junior God Suruzu is a mediocre crowd-controller. While she has range higher than even [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Enchantress Cat]], her 7.2 second recharge means that building up a stack with her is slow, and having them be consistent is even harder, considering her freeze chance is only 20%. Additionally, her freeze can only reach a total of 2.4 seconds with all [[Fruit Treasures]], meanwhile she has a 2.6 second attack frequency, which is another reason why she's bad at her job.

To summarize, just use other anti-Red crowd-controllers, such as [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] or Enchantress Cat.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

